<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><meta name="theme-color" content="#081721"><title>Circa Million Picks & Performance Dashboard</title><meta name="description" content="Frozen NFL models against official Circa contest spreads. Model-only and manual manual cards remain separate, with honest timing, probability and history evidence."><style>
:root{--bg:#081721;--panel:#102532;--line:#2b4958;--ink:#edf6fa;--muted:#abc2cf;--aqua:#83e4e1;--gold:#ffda95;--bad:#ffb2ac;--good:#99edbf}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}a{color:var(--aqua);text-underline-offset:3px}button,input,select{font:inherit}button,select{cursor:pointer}button,a,input,select,summary{outline-offset:4px}button,input,select{background:#112e3c;border:1px solid #527180;color:var(--ink);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px;min-height:42px}button:hover{background:#224858}input{min-width:0}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,60px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.08;max-width:850px}h2{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.025em}h3{font-size:18px}p{margin-top:10px}.shell{max-width:1430px;padding:28px;margin:auto}header{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 15%,#25545d 0,transparent 46%),#0c202d;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;color:var(--aqua)}.hero{padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px}.hero p{max-width:920px;color:#c4d9e3;font-size:17px}.subnav{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0}.pill{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #426270;background:#17313f;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;color:#c7e6ee;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.pill.warn{color:var(--gold);border-color:#7d6b42;background:#342e22}.pill.good{color:var(--good)}.warning{border:1px solid #665b43;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:10px;background:#262922;padding:17px 19px;color:#e4ddce;margin:21px 0}.warning p{font-size:13px}.controls{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;margin:18px 0}.controls label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;min-width:160px;max-width:100%;flex:1}.controls select{max-width:100%}.controls .wide{flex:3;min-width:240px}.sticky{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:#081721f5;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}section{margin:31px 0}.lede{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:1050px}.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.metric,.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel);padding:18px}.metric small{color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}.metric b{display:block;font-size:27px;color:var(--aqua);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:5px 0}.metric span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.card-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:start}.card-title small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.pick-list{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.pick{padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #345765;border-radius:10px;background:#0c202c}.pick .headline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-weight:800}.pick .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.pick.manual{border-color:var(--gold)}.pick b{color:var(--aqua)}.pick .probs{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;margin-top:15px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;background:#0e2330}th,td{padding:11px 13px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}th{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.045em;background:#17313f;color:#c6dbe5}tbody tr:last-child td{border:0}tbody tr:hover{background:#193440}td .sub{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;max-width:300px;white-space:normal}.row-link{border:0;background:none;color:var(--aqua);padding:0;min-height:30px;text-align:left;text-decoration:underline}.mono{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.empty{color:var(--muted);padding:16px;border:1px dashed #466170;border-radius:9px}.grid-champions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:15px}.grid-champions .panel{padding:15px}.grid-champions .panel h3{font-size:15px}.grid-champions .panel p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.grid-champions b{display:block;color:var(--gold);margin-top:8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.fineprint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 17px;margin:12px 0;background:#0e2330}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#d6e9f0;font-weight:700}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal;font-size:11px;color:#c4dfe7}.clock-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.clock-grid p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.clock-grid b{display:block;color:var(--ink)}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}dialog{background:#0b202d;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #668894;border-radius:14px;width:min(1050px,94vw);max-height:90vh;padding:23px;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#000b}.dialog-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:18px}.dialog-head button{flex:none}.bad{color:var(--bad)}.good{color:var(--good)}.gold{color:var(--gold)}.wrap{white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.visually-hidden{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:850px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid-champions,.summary{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.shell{padding:20px}.clock-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:460px){.shell{padding:16px}.summary{gap:8px}.metric{padding:13px}.metric b{font-size:22px}.grid-champions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls label,.controls .wide{min-width:100%;width:100%}.card-title{display:block}.card-title .pill{margin-top:8px}.pick .headline{flex-wrap:wrap}.sticky{position:static}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div class="shell hero"><div class="brand">Sports Edge Lab / NFL / N089</div><h1>Circa Million Picks & Performance Dashboard</h1><p>Compare every available game and every frozen model. Keep the automated card separate from your manual alternative, and see exactly what can—and cannot—be supported by the saved forecasts.</p><nav class="subnav" aria-label="Dashboard navigation"><a href="https://sports-edge-lab-nfl.alv-mendizabal.chatgpt.site/">NFL season dashboard</a><a href="#cards">Five-pick cards</a><a href="#board">Full board</a><a href="#history">Season record</a><a href="#teams">Team splits</a><a href="#audit">Sources & timing</a></nav><div id="header-state"></div></div></header>
<main class="shell"><section id="n090-v11" class="panel" style="margin:24px 0"><h2>V11 continuation and verified recovery</h2><p><strong>Runner preparation; no new owner AWS execution.</strong> Retraining is authorized. Recovered 1,008 native fit receipts with ordered feature recipes and 611 included native model bodies. New owner fits in this review: 0. No automatic promotion.</p><p>Predeclared season weights: 2026 50% / 2025 35% / 2024 15%, with uncertainty and alternative policies. The inherited N089 view retains 40 model views and all 14 Week 10 board games. The separate season dashboard retains all 272 scheduled games.</p><p><strong>Current validated expected-points top five: unavailable.</strong> Archived margin-edge shortlists remain diagnostics. A current recommendation requires validated P(cover) + 0.5 × P(push), genuine predeadline eligibility and exact model-version evidence. No market-superiority claim is made.</p><script id="n090-public-summary" type="application/json">{"schema":"nfl.n090.public-status.v1","status":"V11_RUNNER_PREPARATION_NOT_AWS_EXECUTION","new_fits":0,"automatic_promotion":false,"recovered_native_fit_receipts":1008,"native_receipts_with_ordered_features":1008,"included_native_model_bodies":611,"owner_aws_execution_performed":false,"V11_training_authorized":true,"V11_new_runner_preparation_in_progress":true,"season_weight_policy":{"2024":0.15,"2025":0.35,"2026":0.5},"limitations":["The 272-game season census, 40 model views and 14-game Circa board are inherited verified N089 evidence.","No new owner AWS fits, source refresh, market-superiority result or validated expected-points top five is claimed.","Archived margin-edge cards remain diagnostics; current recommendations require validated cover and push probabilities."]}</script></section><div id="integrity-note" class="warning"></div><div class="summary" id="summary"></div>
<div class="sticky"><div class="controls"><label class="wide">Frozen model / entire card<select id="model-choice" aria-label="Choose frozen model"></select></label><label>Perspective<select id="perspective"><option value="model">Model-only</option><option value="manual">Manual alternative · manual override</option></select></label></div><p class="caption" id="model-caption"></p></div>
<section id="cards"><h2>Five games. Two separate decisions.</h2><p class="lede">A contest card contains exactly five distinct games. Expected Circa points equal probability of covering plus half the probability of a push. An outright win probability does not answer that question.</p><div class="split" style="margin-top:16px"><article class="panel"><div class="card-title"><div><h3>Archived frozen model diagnostic</h3><small>Saved policy and unchanged model forecasts</small></div><span id="model-card-status" class="pill"></span></div><div id="model-card" class="pick-list"></div><p id="model-card-total" class="caption"></p></article><article class="panel"><div class="card-title"><div><h3>Manual alternative</h3><small>Your explicitly requested manual alternative</small></div><span id="manual-card-status" class="pill warn"></span></div><div id="manual-card" class="pick-list"></div><p id="manual-card-total" class="caption"></p><p id="manual-note" class="caption"></p></article></div></section>
<section id="board"><h2>Every game, every remaining alternative</h2><p id="board-note" class="lede"></p><div class="controls"><label>View<select id="board-filter"><option value="all">Complete official board</option><option value="alternatives">Remaining alternatives</option><option value="card">Selected five</option></select></label><label>Find game or team<input id="board-search" type="search" placeholder="Team or game ID"></label></div><p id="board-count" class="caption" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Game / official spread</th><th>Model side / margin advantage</th><th>Cover / push / expected pts</th><th>Scores / outright win</th><th>Confidence / agreement</th><th>Timing / details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="board-rows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="leaders"><h2>Different objectives have different leaders</h2><p class="lede">Five-pick points, full-slate spread accuracy, margin errors and probability calibration are separate measurements. Historical winners are descriptive unless their prior selection and clocks are authenticated.</p><div class="grid-champions" id="champions"></div></section>
<section id="history"><h2>Season and weekly evidence</h2><p class="lede">Original-issued, replay and later reconstruction records remain separate. No retrospective card is presented as a real contest entry.</p><p><button id="load-history">Load full historical evidence</button> <span id="history-load-status" class="caption">Preserved historical rows load on request; no model is fitted.</span></p><div class="controls"><label>Season<select id="history-season"><option value="">All retained seasons</option><option>2024</option><option>2025</option><option>2026</option></select></label><label>Week<select id="history-week"><option value="">All weeks</option></select></label><label>Evidence lane<select id="history-lane"><option value="">All separately labeled lanes</option></select></label><label>Selection scope<select id="history-scope"><option value="full_slate">Full slate ATS</option><option value="five_pick">Five-pick card</option></select></label></div><div id="history-summary" class="summary"></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Season / week / evidence</th><th>W–L–P / graded</th><th>Win % excl. pushes</th><th>Realized / expected points</th><th>Average margin advantage</th><th>Exact games</th></tr></thead><tbody id="history-rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="history-gaps" class="caption"></p></section>
<section id="teams"><h2>Which teams helped or hurt?</h2><p class="lede">Backing a team and opposing that team are different records. These splits inherit the season, week, evidence and selection filters above.</p><div class="controls"><label>Team<input id="team-search" type="search" placeholder="All teams"></label><label>Team direction<select id="team-direction"><option value="">Backed and opposed, separate rows</option><option value="backed">Backed</option><option value="opposed">Opposed</option></select></label></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Team / direction / scope</th><th>W–L–P / graded</th><th>Win % excl. pushes</th><th>Realized / expected points</th><th>Average margin advantage</th><th>Exact games</th></tr></thead><tbody id="team-rows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="audit"><h2>Source clocks and limits</h2><div class="clock-grid" id="clocks"></div><details><summary>Unavailable evidence and missing seasons</summary><div id="gaps"></div></details><details><summary>Preserved model inventory, including unsupported targets</summary><div id="model-inventory"></div></details><details><summary>How the scoring works</summary><p class="fineprint">For the home team, projected spread advantage is projected home margin plus its official spread. A selected side wins against the spread when its final adjusted margin is positive, pushes when it is zero, and loses when negative. Circa points are 1, 0.5 and 0 respectively. Win percentage excludes pushes. Missing predictions are not losses. Expected points require a documented cover-and-push distribution with the correct official line and source clocks.</p><p class="fineprint">Margin-only diagnostic ranking is explicitly provisional. It does not create calibrated cover probabilities or expected points. Manual picks do not alter model forecasts, frozen cards, historical scores, calibration, or actual entry records. No order or contest submission is made by this page.</p></details><details><summary>Archived Weeks 1–9 report</summary><p class="fineprint">The earlier report remains intact at <a href="archive/index.html">its archived view</a>. The historic 23-of-40 five-pick comparison and 67–47–6 full-slate comparison describe different objectives, with reconstruction and source-clock limitations preserved.</p></details></section>
<noscript><div class="warning"><b>Interactive filters require JavaScript.</b><p>The verified snapshot below includes the full board and evidence limits. No file download is needed to read it.</p></div>__NOSCRIPT__</noscript></main>
<dialog id="detail"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="detail-title">Exact evidence</h2><button id="close-detail" aria-label="Close details">Close</button></div><div id="detail-body"></div></dialog><footer><div class="shell">Sports Edge Lab / NFL · Phase A: zero new fits · No automatic promotion · <a href="https://github.com/alvaromendizabal/sports-edge-lab/tree/main/tracks/nfl/circa_million_2026">Public source and audit trail</a></div></footer>
<script id="circa-data" type="application/json">__CIRCA_DATA__</script><script>
